{"4403620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dinonid", "steam_appid": 4403620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinonid tells the story of two dinosaurs in love who want nothing more than to be together. But mountains of freshly laid eggs block their path. Help these two lonely souls and clear a path for them through the landscape of eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is turn-based and is controlled entirely with the keyboard. The goal in each level is to bring the two dinosaurs, Schnuppi and Dinja, together! To do so, you’ll need to remove or navigate around obstacles such as eggs, rocks, and mysterious puzzle boxes. The game includes a detailed audio tutorial.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinonid tells the story of two dinosaurs in love who want nothing more than to be together. But mountains of freshly laid eggs block their path. Help these two lonely souls and clear a path for them through the landscape of eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is turn-based and is controlled entirely with the keyboard. The goal in each level is to bring the two dinosaurs, Schnuppi and Dinja, together! To do so, you’ll need to remove or navigate around obstacles such as eggs, rocks, and mysterious puzzle boxes. The game includes a detailed audio tutorial.</p>", "short_description": "Dinonid tells the story of two dinosaurs in love who want nothing more than to be together. But mountains of freshly laid eggs block their path. Help these two lonely souls and clear a path for them through the landscape of eggs!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4403620/ddf4dbd250ad9b3f3764cb43ccb48bae8c580ca2/header.jpg?t=1787326974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse